msgstr "你的刮削器或 TMDb Helper 提供時顯示爛番茄指數。"

msgctxt "#31594"
msgid "Shows the Trakt score when it is in the library."
msgstr "媒體櫃中有 Trakt 分數時顯示。"

msgctxt "#31595"
