msgid "The glass of the frosted panels: library views, Home panels and the Home bar. Menus and dialogs follow Menu theme. Frost: lighter. Raised: lit rim, deep shadow. Clear: thin, no blur. Dark: darker."
msgstr "霧面面板的玻璃：媒體櫃檢視、主頁面板和主頁列。選單和對話框依照選單主題。霧面：較亮。浮起：亮邊、深陰影。透明：薄。深色：較暗。"

msgctxt "#32552"
msgid "Earlier days"
msgstr "之前的日子"

msgctxt "#32553"
msgid "Also show what aired on the days of this week before today (episodes in your library)."
msgstr "也顯示本週今天之前播出的內容（媒體櫃中的劇集）。"

msgctxt "#32554"
msgid "Menu names in capitals"
msgstr "選單名稱大寫"

msgctxt "#32555"
msgid "Fused Glass: the Home menu names in capital letters instead of sentence case."
msgstr "Fused Glass：主選單名稱使用大寫字母。"

msgctxt "#32556"
msgid "In cinemas now"
msgstr "正在上映"

msgctxt "#32557"
msgid "Airing today"
msgstr "今天播出"

msgctxt "#32558"
msgid "Airing tomorrow"
msgstr "明天播出"

msgctxt "#32559"
msgid "Save lyrics next to the song"
msgstr "將歌詞儲存在歌曲旁邊"

msgctxt "#32560"
msgid "Lyrics that CU LRC Lyrics finds are also saved as a file next to the song (.lrc or .txt), so they are there next time and for other players. The music folder must be writable."
msgstr "CU LRC Lyrics 找到的歌詞也會以檔案 (.lrc 或 .txt) 儲存在歌曲旁邊，下次和其他播放器都能使用。音樂資料夾必須可寫入。"

msgctxt "#32561"
msgid "Home spotlight: recently watched sets"
msgstr "首頁 Spotlight：最近觀看的系列"

msgctxt "#32562"
msgid "The spotlight of a Home item that shows movie sets (Sets, for example) lists the sets you watched last, newest first. Off: all sets, as its spotlight settings say."
msgstr "顯示電影系列的首頁項目（例如「系列」）的 Spotlight 依由新到舊顯示你最近觀看的系列。關閉：依其 Spotlight 設定顯示所有系列。"

msgctxt "#32563"
msgid "Progress rings"
msgstr "進度環"

msgctxt "#32564"
msgid "Season list combined 1"
msgstr "季清單合併 1"

msgctxt "#32565"
msgid "Seasons, episodes, facts"
msgstr "季、劇集與詳情"

msgctxt "#32566"
msgid "Season list combined 2"
msgstr "季清單合併 2"

msgctxt "#32567"
msgid "Poster with episode stills"
msgstr "海報與劇照"

msgctxt "#32568"
msgid "Smooth song progress"
msgstr "平滑顯示歌曲進度"

msgctxt "#32569"
msgid "Fused Glass Now playing: the song's progress behind the waveform glides instead of jumping 1 % at a time. Uses a little more processor time while the screen is open."
msgstr "Fused Glass 正在播放：波形後面的歌曲進度平滑移動，而不是每次跳 1%。畫面開啟時會多佔用一點處理器。"

msgctxt "#32570"
msgid "Progress bar updates per second"
msgstr "進度列每秒更新次數"

msgctxt "#32571"
msgid "Screen"
msgstr "螢幕"

msgctxt "#32572"
msgid "How often a second Smooth song progress moves the fill. Screen: as often as Kodi draws the screen. Fewer updates use less processor time; on a long song even 10 looks smooth."
msgstr "平滑歌曲進度每秒移動填充的次數。螢幕：與 Kodi 繪製畫面的頻率相同。次數越少越省處理器；長歌曲用 10 也很平滑。"

msgctxt "#32590"
msgid "Season poster wall combined"
msgstr "季海報牆合併"

msgctxt "#32573"
msgid "Dark"
msgstr "深色"

msgctxt "#32574"
msgid "Dark: dark panels. Clear: thin glass that shows more of the backdrop. Frost: light frosted glass over the blurred backdrop. Fused Glass: the System screen's menus, full screen with thin rules and a white bar on the row in focus; Kodi starts again."
msgstr "深色：深色面板。透明：薄玻璃，能看到更多背景。霧面：模糊背景上方的淺色霧面玻璃。 Fused Glass：系統畫面的選單，全螢幕、細線，焦點列有白色豎條；Kodi 將重新啟動。"

msgctxt "#32575"
msgid "Home bar"
msgstr "主頁列"

msgctxt "#32576"
msgid "Bar"
msgstr "長條"

msgctxt "#32577"
msgid "Keys"
msgstr "按鍵"

msgctxt "#32578"
msgid "Shelf"
msgstr "橫架"

msgctxt "#32579"
msgid "Frosted glass behind the Home menu, in the material chosen under Look. Bar: one capsule. Keys: glass under each icon. Shelf: a band across the screen."
msgstr "主頁選單後的霧面玻璃，使用在樣式中所選的材質。長條：一個膠囊。按鍵：每個圖示下有玻璃。橫架：橫貫螢幕的玻璃帶。"

msgctxt "#32591"
msgid "Add item"
msgstr "新增項目"

msgctxt "#32592"
msgid "Puts a new item at the end of the menu: one of the skin's items that is not on it yet, or a custom item with its own path, Spotlight and lists.[CR][CR]OK opens the list of types."
msgstr "在選單末尾加入新項目：選單中還沒有的外觀項目，或帶有自己路徑、Spotlight 和清單的自訂項目。[CR][CR]按 OK 開啟類型清單。"

msgctxt "#32593"
msgid "Reload EPG"
msgstr "重新載入 EPG"

msgctxt "#32594"
msgid "Aeon accent colour"
msgstr "Aeon 強調色"

msgctxt "#32595"
msgid "Gold"
msgstr "金色"

msgctxt "#32596"
msgid "Slate"
msgstr "石板灰"

msgctxt "#32597"
msgid "Teal"
msgstr "藍綠"

msgctxt "#32598"
