msgctxt "#32602"
msgid "Round darkens the edges all round. Side darkens the screen from the left and fades out to the right, under the Home text. The row above sets how strong it is."
msgstr "圓形會讓四周邊緣變暗。側邊從左側壓暗畫面並向右漸隱，位於主頁文字下方。強度由上一列設定。"

msgctxt "#32603"
